  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable bed- and bath textiles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a DGGF finance Beddinghouse BV will be able to invest in working capital to support 

its international growth strategy. 

The DGGF finance is a shortfall guarantee to the financing bank for their working capital 

facility increase. 

Beddinghouse is specialized in sustainable bed- and bath textiles and their activities are the 

design, import and international sales of home textiles products. Beddinghouse is market 

leader in the Benelux and has a presence in over 30 countries worldwide. 

Products are being developed in Beddinghouse&#x2019;s own design studio and brought to the 

market in a wide range of own brands and license brands. The product lines of 

Beddinghouse include duvet covers, fitted sheets, moltons, decorative pillows and towels. 

Sustainability &amp; circularity are integrated in the strategy. 

Sourcing of products is from a wide network of producers located in China, India, Pakistan, 

Portugal, Spain and Turkey.  

This financing will support employment for more than 3.000 people.</narrative>
  </description>
